sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Coordinator
  actor O as Field Officer
  participant EV as EvacuationView + EvacuationController
  participant EP as EvacuationPlanner
  participant SRV as Server (ClientHandler + RequestDispatcher)
  participant ES as EvacuationService
  participant DB as MySQL (ShelterDAO)
  participant A as AuditService
  C->>EV: choose open disaster report
  EV->>EP: recommendAlertLevel(severity)
  EP-->>EV: e.g. CRITICAL → Emergency Warning
  C->>EV: zone + shelter, click Issue Warning
  EV->>SRV: Request ISSUE_ALERT (reportId, zone, level, shelterId)
  SRV->>SRV: AccessControl: COORDINATOR or above
  SRV->>ES: issueAlert(user, ...)
  ES->>DB: read report and shelter (must be open and have room)
  ES->>EP: draftMessage(report, level, zone, shelter)
  ES->>DB: INSERT evacuation_alerts (issued_by, issued_at)
  ES->>A: record(ISSUE_ALERT)
  SRV-->>EV: Response.ok(alert)
  Note over EV: Public reporters now see the active warning on their Report screen
  O->>EV: Shelters tab: zone + people, click Recommend
  EV->>SRV: Request RECOMMEND_SHELTER
  SRV->>ES: recommend(zone, people)
  ES->>EP: recommendShelter(shelters, zone, people) [PriorityQueue]
  SRV-->>EV: best shelter selected in table
  O->>EV: click Check in (people)
  EV->>SRV: Request CHECK_IN_EVACUEES
  SRV->>ES: changeOccupancy(user, shelterId, people, true)
  ES->>DB: BEGIN, SELECT shelter FOR UPDATE (row lock)
  alt enough free places
    ES->>DB: UPDATE occupancy, COMMIT
    ES->>A: record(CHECK_IN_EVACUEES)
    SRV-->>EV: ok "n checked in - x/y (OPEN or FULL)"
  else shelter full or closed
    ES->>DB: ROLLBACK
    SRV-->>EV: error "has only k free places"
  end
